<title>USA: Phoenix Resources names new president.</title>
<headline>Phoenix Resources names new president.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phoenix Resources Technologies on Thursday said it named Michael Puhr president.</p>
<p>Puhr succeeds James Ray, who has resigned as president and board member. The company said Ray &quot;is no longer involved in management&quot; of Phoenix Resources.</p>
<p>The company could not be reached for further comment.</p>
</text>
